Subject: [PATCH 01/14] =?UTF-8?q?docs(assumptions):=20A-101..A-106=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20the=20Phase=202=20kickoff=20answers=20(palette,=20s?=
 =?UTF-8?q?cope,=20evidence,=20folder)?=
