- class_color: passable ground drops its strong green dominance (channel
  spread under 0.13) so the team-colored silhouettes pop against it; rock
  drops from [0.41,0.38,0.35] to [0.30,0.27,0.25] so walls and blocked
  terrain read as obstacles at a glance
- the minimap's baked terrain base inherits the calmer palette (it bakes
  from the same mesh colors)
- presentation only: the mesh is display-side, no sim or content change
- test: rock darker than ground at every variation extreme, ground stays
  green-leaning and muted
---
