the Xvfb pass caught it live: the fixed 0.05 NDC hover radius only read at
the Command Center's projected ground point (its tower mass rises well above
it). pick_visible_entity_sized takes a per-entity extra reach; main.rs feeds
footprint * 0.018 so a 4x4 CC reads ~0.072 NDC out. Tests: sized pick reads
what the fixed radius misses, never beyond it
---
